REIWIMSY_TOKEN=
REIWIMSY_REPO=scarletnx/ScarletNX
# Each optional setting a line of its own once it has a value (an empty one stops the service):
# GITHUB_TOKEN=...               a fine-grained token, public repositories read-only: 5000 questions an hour, not
#                                60; the cards need it, and so does the editing of a reply when what it links changes
# REIWIMSY_CARDS_PRS=id          the channel of the pull requests' cards (Developer Mode, Copy Channel ID)
# REIWIMSY_CARDS_ISSUES=id       the channel of the issues' cards
# REIWIMSY_CARDS_NIGHTLY=id      the channel of the nightlies' cards
# REIWIMSY_CHANNELS=id,id        the channels its replies answer in (all it sees without it)
# REIWIMSY_NIGHTLY=OWNER/NAME    where the nightlies are when not OWNER/nightly
